  "question": {
    "text": "For a chemical reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>, it was found that concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is increased by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> in 30 min. The average rate of the reaction is ________ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. (in nearest integer)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p>Av. rate of reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>hr</mi></math></p>",
